    },
    "body": "The object spec looks hopeless and I'm happy with leaving what you've done as the best we can do.\r\n\r\nThe embed spec looks like it would benefit from updating \"To [process response](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#process-response) for the [response](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-response) response:\" to use the actual _processResponse_ argument? I think that'd be a small tweak that would avoid mixing old and new styles and is worth the trouble.",
